join character_overlay center [animation="Instant In"]
join character_richGirl center
character_richGirl: So once I take this, I'll get a vision of when I wish to see the most?
character_richGirl: Sounds straightforward enough.
She chugs the potion
if {success} == true:
	character_richGirl: ...
	character_richGirl (Negative): Ah... So that's how it is.
	character_richGirl: ...
	character_richGirl: Hm... Oh?
	character_richGirl (Positive): I'm okay, thanks.
	character_richGirl: Just a lot to think about, that's all.
	character_richGirl: You wanna know more you say?
	character_richGirl: ...I just have a lot to consider for my future.
	character_richGirl: I am a prince y'know? Anything more than that is confidential info sorry, heh~
	character_richGirl (Positive): Thanks for your service.
	character_richGirl (Positive): I'll forgive that blunder you made the other day, not like it had any lasting consequences in the end heh.
else:
	character_richGirl: *cough cough*
	character_richGirl (Negative): Gah, my head-
	character_richGirl: Wait that's...
	character_richGirl (Negative): WHAT IS THIS... NO, THIS ISN'T WHAT YOU PROMISED ME!?
	character_richGirl (Negative): The future!? What I'm seeing is FAR from it, is this a joke to you?
	character_richGirl (Negative): *she clutches her head, but glares at you*
	character_richGirl (Negative): You're a fraud, through and through...
	character_richGirl (Negative): Tch, I've had just about enough of you.
	She snaps her fingers then turns to leave
	Your vision fades to red, nothing is left
	GAME OVER
	set {gameOver} = true
